      "message": "So previously this was named LegacyVpnRunner which made it clear that this is for Settings VPN, and not something used for regular VPNs.\n\nVpnRunner however is quite generic - and makes it sound like something that would be used for all VPN types, which IIUC is not the case - VpnRunner is something only meant to be used for platform VPNs. \n\nConsider adding a note/javadoc comment or rename this variable to something along the lines of platform VPN type.",
