      "side": 1,
      "message": "Added a comment what this supports.\n\n(Tacking this on so we can look back in future) In terms of renaming this, it\u0027s a little hard, since this is a top-level interface for the following types of VPNs:\n\n1. LegacyVpnRunner\n2. PlatformVpnRunner\n  a. Ikev2VpnRunner\n  b. (In future) WireguardVpnRunner\n\nSo unfortunately, the concept of \"PlatformVpn\" refers to the new VPN API and structure, and has a specific meaning.",
