      "writtenOn": "2020-01-28T21:59:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can\u0027t we rely on just isSettingsVpn? In my mind, SettingsVPN is same as Legacy VPN. If that\u0027s not the case, then we should add a note to isSettingsVpn method.\n\nIf either of them is fine then I\u0027m left wondering which one is the *most* correct. Would be better to pick one and use that in all places.",
